## Inter-layer Scheduling for Tiled Architectures

术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
Inter-layer scheduling是DNN加速器上确定多层计算跨硬件tile的调度方案的过程，涵盖四个核心design factors：(1) Execution Scheme (E)——决定多层workload如何时空映射到多个tile（Sequential/Pipeline/Parallel三种基本模式）；(2) Fusion Strategy (F)——决定是否将前一层的输出直接通过on-chip SRAM传递给后一层（避免昂贵的off-chip DRAM访问）；(3) Recomputation Scheme (R)——决定哪些中间activation在memory不足时被丢弃并在需要时重新计算（以计算换存储，主要应用于training）；(4) Batch Splitting Plan (B)——将batch划分为更小的sub-batch依次处理以降低单次memory需求。Inter-layer scheduling与intra-layer scheduling相对：intra-layer focus on mapping individual layers to PE arrays within tiles；inter-layer focus on cross-layer execution order, memory behavior, and resource allocation。

